## Check the implementation

Test notices with errors, narrow screens, long translations and updates arriving while the user is typing. Fixed notice and success roles remain stable across brand palettes.

Use the [civica.uk accessibility checks](../accessibility/testing.html) and compare the rendered result in light and dark modes, Vivid and Muted tones, and at 320 CSS pixels. The example markup is a starting point; a theme alone does not add its application logic.

## Source and related guidance

[NHS notification banners](https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/components/notification-banners) informs the component choice and interaction guidance. The examples use shared GOV.UK primitives or original civica.uk markup, Arial typography and civica.uk assets. NHS logos and service identity are not used.

